WEBVTT

00:58:59.792 --> 00:59:01.768
but then doesn't want anybody to do it

00:59:01.792 --> 00:59:04.143
because nobody would
do it the way they do it.

00:59:04.167 --> 00:59:05.976
(Laughter)

00:59:06.000 --> 00:59:08.792
That is raised for autonomy
to the end degree.

00:59:09.750 --> 00:59:11.809
You know that person
in your personal life,

00:59:11.833 --> 00:59:14.476
you know that person at work.

00:59:14.500 --> 00:59:17.601
So you mapped this on a whole line here,

00:59:17.625 --> 00:59:19.809
between the degree of, you know,

00:59:19.833 --> 00:59:22.476
I'm going to hide the fact
that I don't know something.

00:59:22.500 --> 00:59:25.684
So when people these days
talk about trust for vulnerability,

00:59:25.708 --> 00:59:29.143
one of the first things they talk about
is asking for help, right?

00:59:29.167 --> 00:59:31.809
The disclosure of the leader
and the people who can say,